  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:218px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Audrey2.png\" title=\"Audrey the Alchemist\"><img alt=\"Audrey the Alchemist\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"377\" src=\"/images/recovered/Audrey2.png\" width=\"216\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/Audrey2.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Audrey the Alchemist</div></div></div>\n<p>Audrey the Alchemist is standing on a platform next to the <a href=\"/wiki/Obelisk\" title=\"Obelisk\">Obelisk</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Townston\" title=\"Townston\">Townston</a>. \n</p><p>She sells the player <a href=\"/wiki/Health_Potions\" title=\"Health Potions\">Health Potions</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Mana_Potions\" title=\"Mana Potions\">Mana Potions</a> and also <a href=\"/wiki/Waypoint_Scrolls\" title=\"Waypoint Scrolls\">Waypoint Scrolls</a>, and buys <a href=\"/wiki/Items\" title=\"Items\">Loot</a> of all kinds. She also gives some quests. \n</p>\n<table class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" summary=\"Contents\"><tr><td><div id=\"toctitle\"><h2>Contents</h2></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Audrey.27s_Quests\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Audrey's Quests</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#Dew_Valley\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dew Valley</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#Algernon\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Algernon</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#Algor.27s_Terror_Dome\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Algor's Terror Dome</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#Vergrim.27s_Vexation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Vergrim's Vexation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#Widower.27s_Nest\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Widower's Nest</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#Ratsputin.27s_Gulag\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Ratsputin's Gulag</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td></tr></table>\n<a name=\"Audrey.27s_Quests\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Audrey's Quests</span></h2>\n<a name=\"Dew_Valley\"></a><h3> <span class=\"mw-headline\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dew_Valley\" title=\"Dew Valley\">Dew Valley</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Fizz_Rock_Delivery\" title=\"Fizz Rock Delivery\">Fizz Rock Delivery</a>\n</li></ul>\n<a name=\"Algernon\"></a><h3> <span class=\"mw-headline\"><a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Find_Me_Hubby\" title=\"Find Me Hubby\">Find Me Hubby</a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Digging_Deep\" title=\"Digging Deep\">Digging Deep</a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Porthole_Science\" title=\"Porthole Science\">Porthole Science</a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_the_Midnight_Fizz_Rock\" title=\"Burning the Midnight Fizz Rock\">Burning the Midnight Fizz Rock</a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Rumored_Refinery\" title=\"Rumored Refinery\">Rumored Refinery</a>\n</li></ul>\n<a name=\"Algor.27s_Terror_Dome\"></a><h3> <span class=\"mw-headline\"><a href=\"/wiki/Algor's_Terror_Dome\" title=\"Algor's Terror Dome\">Algor's Terror Dome</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Tall_Glass_of_Puker_Juice\" title=\"Tall Glass of Puker Juice\">Tall Glass of Puker Juice</a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Bottomless_Glass_of_Puker_Juice\" title=\"Bottomless Glass of Puker Juice\">Bottomless Glass of Puker Juice</a>\n</li></ul>\n<a name=\"Vergrim.27s_Vexation\"></a><h3> <span class=\"mw-headline\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vexation\" title=\"Vergrim's Vexation\">Vergrim's Vexation</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Fish_Farming\" title=\"Fish Farming\">Fish Farming</a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Crazy_Cat_Lady\" title=\"Crazy Cat Lady\">Crazy Cat Lady</a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Supply_N'_Destroy!\" title=\"Supply N' Destroy!\">Supply N' Destroy!</a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Fizz_Drink_Challenge\" title=\"The Fizz Drink Challenge\">The Fizz Drink Challenge</a>\n</li></ul>\n<a name=\"Widower.27s_Nest\"></a><h3> <span class=\"mw-headline\"><a href=\"/wiki/Widower's_Nest\" title=\"Widower's Nest\">Widower's Nest</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Widower's_Nest_Gopher\" title=\"The Widower's Nest Gopher\">The Widower's Nest Gopher</a>\n</li></ul>\n<a name=\"Ratsputin.27s_Gulag\"></a><h3> <span class=\"mw-headline\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin's_Gulag\" title=\"Ratsputin's Gulag\">Ratsputin's Gulag</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li> <a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin's_Nesting_Dolls\" title=\"Ratsputin's Nesting Dolls\">Ratsputin's Nesting Dolls</a>\n</li></ul>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
